    <detaileddescription>
<para>Generic ASCII case-insensitive less than comparison. This class returns numerically ordered ASCII case-insensitive text for all possible sizes and types of SI_CHAR. It is not safe for MBCS text comparison where ASCII A-Z characters are used in the encoding of multi-byte characters. </para>
